{title: 593 - In Times Like These}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #593 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 593}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]In [Eb7]times like [Ab]these you need a [Bbm7]Sav[Eb7]ior,
In times like these you need an [Db]an[Ab]chor;
Be very sure, be very [Db]sure
Your [Fm]anchor [Ab]holds and grips the sol[Eb7]id[Ab]Rock!
This [Eb7]Rock [Ab]is [Eb7]Jesus, Yes, He’s the [Ab]One;
This [Eb7]Rock [Ab]is [Eb7]Jesus, The only [Ab]One!
Be very sure, be very [Db]sure
Your [Fm]anchor [Ab]holds and grips the sol[Eb7]id[Ab]Rock!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]In [Eb7]times like [Ab]these [Bbm7]you need [Eb7]the Bible,
[Db]In times like these [Ab]O be not idle;
[Db]Be very sure, be very sure Your anchor holds and grips the Solid rock!
[Fm]This Rock [Ab]is Jesus, [Eb7]Yes, He's [Ab]the One;
[Eb7]This [Ab]Rock is [Eb7]Jesus, The [Ab]only One!
[Eb7]Be very sure, [Ab]be very sure Your [Eb7]anchor holds and [Ab]grips the Solid rock!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]In [Eb7]times like [Ab]these [Bbm7]I have [Eb7]a Savior,
[Db]In times like these [Ab]I have an anchor
[Db]I'm very sure, be very sure Your anchor holds and grips the Solid rock!
[Fm]This Rock [Ab]is Jesus, [Eb7]Yes, He's [Ab]the One;
[Eb7]This [Ab]Rock is [Eb7]Jesus, The [Ab]only One!
[Eb7]I'm very sure, [Ab]be very sure Your [Eb7]anchor holds and [Ab]grips the Solid rock!
{end_of_verse}
